(3128125, 439237, 55397, '<td valign="top">You are so incredibly imaginative!  I love this picture - the makeup, the use of the sticky-notes, the whole feel.  When I first saw it I audibly said, "WOW!"  And compared to the other sticky-note entries, this really stands out; has some class.</td>', 'You are so incredibly imaginative!  I love this picture - the makeup, the use of the sticky-notes, the whole feel.  When I first saw it I audibly said, "WOW!"  And compared to the other sticky-note entries, this really stands out; has some class.', '2006-12-18 08:40:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(3128127, 439626, 69934, '<td valign="top">I like the diagonal. Nice micro. The detail with the scratches on the fork are great. The backgroung being so flat does bother me a bit. Overall nice work.</td>', 'I like the diagonal. Nice micro. The detail with the scratches on the fork are great. The backgroung being so flat does bother me a bit. Overall nice work.', '2006-12-18 08:40:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(3128135, 439255, 55397, '<td valign="top">From dirt to lollipops - you sure do have a lot of kid left in ya.  This made me laugh. I like it alot!  And I like you alot too!</td>', 'From dirt to lollipops - you sure do have a lot of kid left in ya.  This made me laugh. I like it alot!  And I like you alot too!', '2006-12-18 08:43:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(3128161, 439715, 63495, '<td valign="top">they dont look very sticky yet but give them to a 3 yr old then you go sticky.<br/>but its a great shot, love the bright colors. 8</td>', 'they dont look very sticky yet but give them to a 3 yr old then you go sticky.but its a great shot, love the bright colors. 8', '2006-12-18 08:52:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(3128177, 438478, 63495, '<td valign="top">very cute model, but my eye doesnt know where to foucs so i guess its too busy</td>', 'very cute model, but my eye doesnt know where to foucs so i guess its too busy', '2006-12-18 08:55:23.000000', NULL, 1),
