(3128193, 439860, 63495, '<td valign="top">you should have gave him another 10 minutes then it would have been real sticky. very cute shot. i like the way my eye focuses on the mouth the sticky part of the photo</td>', 'you should have gave him another 10 minutes then it would have been real sticky. very cute shot. i like the way my eye focuses on the mouth the sticky part of the photo', '2006-12-18 09:00:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(3128245, 439255, 32767, '<td valign="top">Tim...you need a shave</td>', 'Tim...you need a shave', '2006-12-18 09:24:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(3128250, 439616, 66816, '<td valign="top">That''s really neat. Yours is the only photo that doesn''t have some kind of sticky goo reflecting in fake lighting. I like it a lot.</td>', 'That''s really neat. Yours is the only photo that doesn''t have some kind of sticky goo reflecting in fake lighting. I like it a lot.', '2006-12-18 09:28:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(3128253, 439698, 66816, '<td valign="top">I like the fact that the picture focuses on the boy and his gorgeous blue eyes rather than on the stickiness. It''s is just part of the picture, not an obviously set up shot of a cute kid sucking on some kind of sticky candy. It feels more natural, and therefore much more interesting.</td>', 'I like the fact that the picture focuses on the boy and his gorgeous blue eyes rather than on the stickiness. It''s is just part of the picture, not an obviously set up shot of a cute kid sucking on some kind of sticky candy. It feels more natural, and therefore much more interesting.', '2006-12-18 09:30:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(3128257, 438329, 63163, '<td valign="top">DNMC to me and what I think the challenge means.  I do, however, love the way you captured the irredesence and the colors.  I''m giving it a 5, would of been higher if "I" thought it met challenge.</td>', 'DNMC to me and what I think the challenge means.  I do, however, love the way you captured the irredesence and the colors.  I''m giving it a 5, would of been higher if "I" thought it met challenge.', '2006-12-18 09:32:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(3128259, 439513, 66201, '<td valign="top">Is that you Christian?  Love it...very original...not so much sticky sweet stuff and candy...just STICKY. Can relate too. Title works well. I like the lime/green sat against the otherwise grey background.9</td>', 'Is that you Christian?  Love it...very original...not so much sticky sweet stuff and candy...just STICKY. Can relate too. Title works well. I like the lime/green sat against the otherwise grey background.9', '2006-12-18 09:33:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(3128262, 439715, 66201, '<td valign="top">What fun... gorgeous colours.8...as yet unsticky but the potential is there!!</td>', 'What fun... gorgeous colours.8...as yet unsticky but the potential is there!!', '2006-12-18 09:34:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(3128263, 439255, 66201, '<td valign="top">Ahh very funny...what a great image to wake up to this Monday morning. well done. 9</td>', 'Ahh very funny...what a great image to wake up to this Monday morning. well done. 9', '2006-12-18 09:34:37.000000', NULL, 1),
