(3128266, 439476, 66201, '<td valign="top">oh dear...very sticky. What fun. Maybe too much foreground bowl and unfocussed marshmellow...perhaps if you had made the face more dominant in the composition...? dunno. 8</td>', 'oh dear...very sticky. What fun. Maybe too much foreground bowl and unfocussed marshmellow...perhaps if you had made the face more dominant in the composition...? dunno. 8', '2006-12-18 09:35:48.000000', NULL, 1),
