(3128273, 439800, 63163, '<td valign="top">The lighting looks to harsh on the face and on the hand.  I also don''t care for the heavy gold boarder.  Definatly meets challange and I would not want to have to clean that up!!</td>', 'The lighting looks to harsh on the face and on the hand.  I also don''t care for the heavy gold boarder.  Definatly meets challange and I would not want to have to clean that up!!', '2006-12-18 09:38:33.000000', NULL, 1),
