(3129473, 439575, 67537, '<td valign="top">Although it is titled a sticky bun, I dont really see the sticky part of it. Usually the sticky part is the icing, but being that it isn''t stuck to anything, I dont see how its sticky. Plus, being that this is an advanced editing challenge, you should have taken advantage of that and edited out the piece of bun on the tissue paper and the glare behind you on the right. Sorry!! I hope these help though for next time!</td>', 'Although it is titled a sticky bun, I dont really see the sticky part of it. Usually the sticky part is the icing, but being that it isn''t stuck to anything, I dont see how its sticky. Plus, being that this is an advanced editing challenge, you should have taken advantage of that and edited out the piece of bun on the tissue paper and the glare behind you on the right. Sorry!! I hope these help though for next time!', '2006-12-18 17:38:54.000000', NULL, 1),
