(3129959, 439706, 53316, '<td valign="top">Krisby? I think those are your beautiful cheeks!<br/>Great picture.  Skin tones are great... the freckles on both people are so great together. I like the texture of the background and the choice of black and white, as well as the not in-your-face border.  And it looks like the profiles of both people just fit together like puzzle pieces.  10!</td>', 'Krisby? I think those are your beautiful cheeks!Great picture.  Skin tones are great... the freckles on both people are so great together. I like the texture of the background and the choice of black and white, as well as the not in-your-face border.  And it looks like the profiles of both people just fit together like puzzle pieces.  10!', '2006-12-18 21:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
