(3135330, 439817, 67841, '<td valign="top">You should try to make a custom font like this! The letter work is spot on. <br/> <br/>You went a bit too far on the sharpening or contrast - sorta pushed it over the edge, I have a bad tendency to sometimes do that too, I usually reign it in before its too late.  The organic element of the honey begs for the image to be more natural, to me anyway.  Try the high-pass technique next time as that leaves you a layer to play with in the end to adjust sharpness if color tweaking has brought out harshness. I like the composition, though the flower comes off as out of place at first.  IMHO, a more traditional ''bee flower'' (whatever that is, right? lol) would have been a better choice.<br/> <br/>Overall, nicely lit &amp; executed with a few detractions during post-processing -- 7 --</td>', 'You should try to make a custom font like this! The letter work is spot on.  You went a bit too far on the sharpening or contrast - sorta pushed it over the edge, I have a bad tendency to sometimes do that too, I usually reign it in before its too late.  The organic element of the honey begs for the image to be more natural, to me anyway.  Try the high-pass technique next time as that leaves you a layer to play with in the end to adjust sharpness if color tweaking has brought out harshness. I like the composition, though the flower comes off as out of place at first.  IMHO, a more traditional ''bee flower'' (whatever that is, right? lol) would have been a better choice. Overall, nicely lit & executed with a few detractions during post-processing -- 7 --', '2006-12-20 11:04:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(3135425, 439768, 67841, '<td valign="top">Nice execution | the glistening is a great effect here | perfect DOF -- 9 --</td>', 'Nice execution | the glistening is a great effect here | perfect DOF -- 9 --', '2006-12-20 11:28:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(3135437, 439746, 67841, '<td valign="top">Awesomely funny | nice contrast between the foreground being a great product shot &amp; the background being awful with the shadow &amp; all |  that expression is priceless  | I would have liked to see some syrup dripping down the side of the can -- 9 --</td>', 'Awesomely funny | nice contrast between the foreground being a great product shot & the background being awful with the shadow & all |  that expression is priceless  | I would have liked to see some syrup dripping down the side of the can -- 9 --', '2006-12-20 11:31:01.000000', NULL, 1),
