(3135445, 439247, 67841, '<td valign="top">Nice idea  | I immediately thought how cool it would have been if you had drawn a flower with the honey | Unfortunately, it''s a tad overexposed &amp; soft on focus -- 6 --</td>', 'Nice idea  | I immediately thought how cool it would have been if you had drawn a flower with the honey | Unfortunately, it''s a tad overexposed & soft on focus -- 6 --', '2006-12-20 11:35:23.000000', NULL, 1),
