(3135486, 438547, 67841, '<td valign="top">Nice colors, though the background would have looked better with just one color, IMHO | A little soft &amp; a little overexposed | Wish the image had more interest overall - a unique pattern or something... | Will give an extra point for out-of-the-box thinking  -- 6 --</td>', 'Nice colors, though the background would have looked better with just one color, IMHO | A little soft & a little overexposed | Wish the image had more interest overall - a unique pattern or something... | Will give an extra point for out-of-the-box thinking  -- 6 --', '2006-12-20 11:48:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(3135496, 439853, 67841, '<td valign="top">Great color tones | Near perfect lighting &amp; exposure | Nice bit of sensuality thrown in, but I''m not fond of the harshness that crept in on the lips nor the hotspots on the teeth -- 9 --</td>', 'Great color tones | Near perfect lighting & exposure | Nice bit of sensuality thrown in, but I''m not fond of the harshness that crept in on the lips nor the hotspots on the teeth -- 9 --', '2006-12-20 11:52:12.000000', NULL, 1),
