(3135510, 439767, 67841, '<td valign="top">Nice bg color &amp; tone | Excellent golden tone to the honey | Focus is very good but not great | Wish the shutter speed had been higher (the motion blur seems out of place with the rest of the image) <br/> <br/>Overall a very nice job on this -- 9 --</td>', 'Nice bg color & tone | Excellent golden tone to the honey | Focus is very good but not great | Wish the shutter speed had been higher (the motion blur seems out of place with the rest of the image)  Overall a very nice job on this -- 9 --', '2006-12-20 11:55:59.000000', NULL, 1),
