(3135715, 438983, 50695, '<td valign="top">Flies are so ugly, but there is a hint of beauty here. It just needs something to get it over the hump. Perhaps if the flies were in better focus without necessarily being more detailed. 6</td>', 'Flies are so ugly, but there is a hint of beauty here. It just needs something to get it over the hump. Perhaps if the flies were in better focus without necessarily being more detailed. 6', '2006-12-20 12:46:10.000000', NULL, 1),
