(3135719, 439429, 50695, '<td valign="top">This is the kind of shot I don''t normally like, staged with a single subject, but there are some subtle touches that really make this work: the narrow DOF on the face with creepy facial hair, the touch of gum to the nose, the womb-like shape of the bubble. 7 bump to 8</td>', 'This is the kind of shot I don''t normally like, staged with a single subject, but there are some subtle touches that really make this work: the narrow DOF on the face with creepy facial hair, the touch of gum to the nose, the womb-like shape of the bubble. 7 bump to 8', '2006-12-20 12:46:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(3135994, 439828, 5112, '<td valign="top">Grandma looks very happy playing with the molasses!  I bet she''s a good cookie maker.  She has such a beautiful smile, and I like how you framed that smile with the spoon/hand, and emphasized it with the pink (almost same colour as her lips) apron.  ~</td>', 'Grandma looks very happy playing with the molasses!  I bet she''s a good cookie maker.  She has such a beautiful smile, and I like how you framed that smile with the spoon/hand, and emphasized it with the pink (almost same colour as her lips) apron.  ~', '2006-12-20 14:10:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(3135998, 437411, 5112, '<td valign="top">I think I''m missing something about the concept of the photo, but it is a funny image, and the shadows really add to it.  ~</td>', 'I think I''m missing something about the concept of the photo, but it is a funny image, and the shadows really add to it.  ~', '2006-12-20 14:11:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(3136006, 439237, 5112, '<td valign="top">This is so good!  Fantastic.  I''m not sure it gives the idea of "sticky" totally, I mean, when I first look at it, I think, beauty and inventiveness and carnival, and cirque (of course), but not sticky immediately.  Nevertheless, it''s a great entry.  ~9</td>', 'This is so good!  Fantastic.  I''m not sure it gives the idea of "sticky" totally, I mean, when I first look at it, I think, beauty and inventiveness and carnival, and cirque (of course), but not sticky immediately.  Nevertheless, it''s a great entry.  ~9', '2006-12-20 14:12:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(3136017, 439860, 5112, '<td valign="top">That expression is adorable, you caught it just right!  The only thing I can think of that maybe (or maybe not) would make the image a bit stronger is to get in a bit closer (or trim off a bit from the right side and from the top).  I''ve been trying to do that here on the screen, using two pieces of paper, and it looks good either way.  ~8</td>', 'That expression is adorable, you caught it just right!  The only thing I can think of that maybe (or maybe not) would make the image a bit stronger is to get in a bit closer (or trim off a bit from the right side and from the top).  I''ve been trying to do that here on the screen, using two pieces of paper, and it looks good either way.  ~8', '2006-12-20 14:14:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(3136372, 439801, 5112, '<td valign="top">It took me a moment to find both of them :)  I like how the sap hanging from the tree  looks almost like icicles.  I also like the texture/pattern it creates, especially where it criss-crosses at a diagonal with the cut marks.  It certainly makes you think of "sticky".  ~7</td>', 'It took me a moment to find both of them :)  I like how the sap hanging from the tree  looks almost like icicles.  I also like the texture/pattern it creates, especially where it criss-crosses at a diagonal with the cut marks.  It certainly makes you think of "sticky".  ~7', '2006-12-20 16:06:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(3136376, 439139, 5112, '<td valign="top">Very good idea for the challenge.  Well made.  If I could mention one nitpick, it looks a bit "staged", sort of like he''s trying to give the impression of "Ewwww!", but doesn''t have his heart into it entirely (like he''s gong to break out laughing in a moment or two).  Love the totally white background.  ~7</td>', 'Very good idea for the challenge.  Well made.  If I could mention one nitpick, it looks a bit "staged", sort of like he''s trying to give the impression of "Ewwww!", but doesn''t have his heart into it entirely (like he''s gong to break out laughing in a moment or two).  Love the totally white background.  ~7', '2006-12-20 16:07:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(3136381, 439367, 5112, '<td valign="top">Beautiful, almost abstract, and yet, so easy to relate to.  Love the colour combination.  The picture makes me want to rub my finger over the screen and then see how it tastes.  ~9</td>', 'Beautiful, almost abstract, and yet, so easy to relate to.  Love the colour combination.  The picture makes me want to rub my finger over the screen and then see how it tastes.  ~9', '2006-12-20 16:08:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(3136387, 439511, 5112, '<td valign="top">To my thinking, it gives the idea of "trash" better than "sticky".  However, it''s a funny shot.  I feel sorry for your model :)  ~6</td>', 'To my thinking, it gives the idea of "trash" better than "sticky".  However, it''s a funny shot.  I feel sorry for your model :)  ~6', '2006-12-20 16:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(3136402, 439771, 5112, '<td valign="top">Good idea for "sticky", it does look sticky.  It would be nice if the image were larger (you can go up to 640 pixels on the longest side, or 640 px square).  I like the colour of the marshmallows.  However, as it is, it is not a winning shot.  It looks a bit blurry, and it doesn''t have all that much of interest in it overall.  I like  how you got the pan so nice and black.  ~4</td>', 'Good idea for "sticky", it does look sticky.  It would be nice if the image were larger (you can go up to 640 pixels on the longest side, or 640 px square).  I like the colour of the marshmallows.  However, as it is, it is not a winning shot.  It looks a bit blurry, and it doesn''t have all that much of interest in it overall.  I like  how you got the pan so nice and black.  ~4', '2006-12-20 16:12:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(3136410, 439698, 5112, '<td valign="top">The image looks amazingly flat, I mean, not flat in the sense of no dynamic range, but flat in the sense of no depth.  I think the grain is what makes it look that way, sort of like the same as images in a newspaper often look very flat.  Those eyes are beautiful!  ~6</td>', 'The image looks amazingly flat, I mean, not flat in the sense of no dynamic range, but flat in the sense of no depth.  I think the grain is what makes it look that way, sort of like the same as images in a newspaper often look very flat.  Those eyes are beautiful!  ~6', '2006-12-20 16:14:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(3136419, 439805, 5112, '<td valign="top">... and tasty!  If I were you (and I''ve never tried food photography, so I don''t really know what I''m talking about, which isn''t going to stop me, he, he, he), I''d put the bun on a beautiful plate, maybe a fork (very clean) on the edge, or a napkin, something to give it more story, and I''d clean out the little hanger drops (just juicy fat drops).  The top part of the bun looks particularily good in this image.  I think it might be good to no centre it so much.  ~6</td>', '... and tasty!  If I were you (and I''ve never tried food photography, so I don''t really know what I''m talking about, which isn''t going to stop me, he, he, he), I''d put the bun on a beautiful plate, maybe a fork (very clean) on the edge, or a napkin, something to give it more story, and I''d clean out the little hanger drops (just juicy fat drops).  The top part of the bun looks particularily good in this image.  I think it might be good to no centre it so much.  ~6', '2006-12-20 16:16:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(3136420, 439040, 5112, '<td valign="top">He, he, is that "really" the latin name?  :)  Good shot.  ~7</td>', 'He, he, is that "really" the latin name?  :)  Good shot.  ~7', '2006-12-20 16:16:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(3136426, 439005, 5112, '<td valign="top">Wow, they have big tongues!  I like the sense of motion in the image, it''s not that strong, but it''s there.  I wonder if a less square cut would intensify it.  ~6</td>', 'Wow, they have big tongues!  I like the sense of motion in the image, it''s not that strong, but it''s there.  I wonder if a less square cut would intensify it.  ~6', '2006-12-20 16:18:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(3136429, 439548, 5112, '<td valign="top">Beautiful how you caught it just there.  I like it how there are parts of the syrup that are very transparent, others semi-opaque, and yet others completely opaque, and how the colour changes from section to section.  ~8</td>', 'Beautiful how you caught it just there.  I like it how there are parts of the syrup that are very transparent, others semi-opaque, and yet others completely opaque, and how the colour changes from section to section.  ~8', '2006-12-20 16:19:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(3136447, 439008, 5112, '<td valign="top">Now this looks sticky!  Like a terrible sticky monster of some sort.  Did you try red in back?  (just curious).  Makes me want to say, "Good, sticky, and ugly" (ugly in a good sense).  ~8</td>', 'Now this looks sticky!  Like a terrible sticky monster of some sort.  Did you try red in back?  (just curious).  Makes me want to say, "Good, sticky, and ugly" (ugly in a good sense).  ~8', '2006-12-20 16:23:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(3136448, 439871, 5112, '<td valign="top">Nicely presented.  The light is a bit flat, and the shadows are a bit distracting.  ~5</td>', 'Nicely presented.  The light is a bit flat, and the shadows are a bit distracting.  ~5', '2006-12-20 16:24:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(3136451, 439468, 5112, '<td valign="top">As in memories that stick with you?  Metaphorical sticky.  The image is really quite beautiful, the sky, in particular, is really good to look at.  ~7</td>', 'As in memories that stick with you?  Metaphorical sticky.  The image is really quite beautiful, the sky, in particular, is really good to look at.  ~7', '2006-12-20 16:25:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(3136456, 439508, 5112, '<td valign="top">I really like the out of focus fire in back!  The marshmallow almost look like tiger fur.  I like the texture on the backside of the fingers, and I like the composition.  ~8</td>', 'I really like the out of focus fire in back!  The marshmallow almost look like tiger fur.  I like the texture on the backside of the fingers, and I like the composition.  ~8', '2006-12-20 16:27:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(3136461, 439616, 5112, '<td valign="top">You forgot, she''s also stuck to the phone.  I like her "cellphone expression".  Those poles are works of art.  ~8</td>', 'You forgot, she''s also stuck to the phone.  I like her "cellphone expression".  Those poles are works of art.  ~8', '2006-12-20 16:29:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(3136464, 439767, 5112, '<td valign="top">Really well done.  But I like macros a lot :)  ~10</td>', 'Really well done.  But I like macros a lot :)  ~10', '2006-12-20 16:30:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(3136469, 439255, 5112, '<td valign="top">Yuk!  Good entry though.  ~8</td>', 'Yuk!  Good entry though.  ~8', '2006-12-20 16:31:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(3136473, 439881, 5112, '<td valign="top">I like it how you have the sunday at the bottom, the big blue background, and the thin line of butterscotch going down to it.  It would be nice if the image were larger (you can go up to 640 pixels on the longest side, or 640 px square), and it might be good to run a noise remover on the background as it looks somewhat pixelated.  ~6</td>', 'I like it how you have the sunday at the bottom, the big blue background, and the thin line of butterscotch going down to it.  It would be nice if the image were larger (you can go up to 640 pixels on the longest side, or 640 px square), and it might be good to run a noise remover on the background as it looks somewhat pixelated.  ~6', '2006-12-20 16:33:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(3136479, 439713, 5112, '<td valign="top">Wow, those are killer eyes!  Big pupils.  And it looks awfully sticky!  As a mother, I can sympathize with this, from the face to the hands to the clothing, to the furniture, to everywhere, oyyyyy!  Good entry.  ~9</td>', 'Wow, those are killer eyes!  Big pupils.  And it looks awfully sticky!  As a mother, I can sympathize with this, from the face to the hands to the clothing, to the furniture, to everywhere, oyyyyy!  Good entry.  ~9', '2006-12-20 16:35:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(3136482, 439513, 5112, '<td valign="top">The eyes and the towel are almost the same colour!  I hope it doesn''t hurt.  Pain is bad.  ~7</td>', 'The eyes and the towel are almost the same colour!  I hope it doesn''t hurt.  Pain is bad.  ~7', '2006-12-20 16:35:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(3136856, 439511, 67789, '<td valign="top">cool idea... great composition... model &amp; photographer both good job...</td>', 'cool idea... great composition... model & photographer both good job...', '2006-12-20 17:50:41.000000', NULL, 1),
