(3140790, 439616, 38032, '<td valign="top">You''re leading me ... the phone i stuck to her head too right?! - I really like the pole and the image in general.  Well done.</td>', 'You''re leading me ... the phone i stuck to her head too right?! - I really like the pole and the image in general.  Well done.', '2006-12-21 23:54:17.000000', NULL, 1),
