(3140815, 439853, 38032, '<td valign="top">You pretty much have this one in the bag me thinks - the stylish, seductive pose - the texture of the lip and lighting - the skin details - pretty amazing.  The nose and the honey are just 95% each ... so 9</td>', 'You pretty much have this one in the bag me thinks - the stylish, seductive pose - the texture of the lip and lighting - the skin details - pretty amazing.  The nose and the honey are just 95% each ... so 9', '2006-12-21 23:59:53.000000', NULL, 1),
