(3141395, 439616, 35602, '<td valign="top">Nice street shot.  That green coat really does do wonders for a photo that  would have been ho hum if it had been black or brown.</td>', 'Nice street shot.  That green coat really does do wonders for a photo that  would have been ho hum if it had been black or brown.', '2006-12-22 07:15:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(3141399, 439820, 35602, '<td valign="top">This would have been absolutely stunning if you had used a bit more fill in light.  It has a definite beauty that seems too hidden in the orangy cast of the image.  I know that the image is supposed to be honey color, but it did cause a dulling of the great detail you captured in this.</td>', 'This would have been absolutely stunning if you had used a bit more fill in light.  It has a definite beauty that seems too hidden in the orangy cast of the image.  I know that the image is supposed to be honey color, but it did cause a dulling of the great detail you captured in this.', '2006-12-22 07:17:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(3141400, 439261, 35602, '<td valign="top">Seems fuzzy and the exposure overall is very uneven.  A bit more work with highlights and shadows might have brightened up the bee and dulled down the grass.  Right now the contrast is too much the same overall, and the grasses catch your eye first because they are brighter.</td>', 'Seems fuzzy and the exposure overall is very uneven.  A bit more work with highlights and shadows might have brightened up the bee and dulled down the grass.  Right now the contrast is too much the same overall, and the grasses catch your eye first because they are brighter.', '2006-12-22 07:19:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(3141402, 439502, 35602, '<td valign="top">Great detail and color representation.</td>', 'Great detail and color representation.', '2006-12-22 07:20:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(3141406, 439705, 35602, '<td valign="top">Very realistic situation.  Gum needs better light and focus, since that is the most important aspect of this challenge.</td>', 'Very realistic situation.  Gum needs better light and focus, since that is the most important aspect of this challenge.', '2006-12-22 07:25:21.000000', NULL, 1),
