(3143731, 439698, 56828, '<td valign="top">This is a great photo.  The color (or lack thereof) and noise effect are a great addition to this photo.  There are some parts that are a little overexposed, but still an amazing photo.</td>', 'This is a great photo.  The color (or lack thereof) and noise effect are a great addition to this photo.  There are some parts that are a little overexposed, but still an amazing photo.', '2006-12-23 00:17:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(3143735, 439478, 56828, '<td valign="top">Challenge:  This is highly highly borderline in even meeting the challenge without a title.  I''ll give you some credit because your focus is on the center of the flower which does stick to bees.  But without a title I would have seen it as just another flower shot.<br/> <br/>Technical:  It could use a little more focus.  The photo looks pretty blurry.  The crop is too tight, but if you were going to go that tight, you should have cut some of the greenery out of the bottom.  For an advanced editing challenge, I would have liked to have seen the colors boosted a little more as well.</td>', 'Challenge:  This is highly highly borderline in even meeting the challenge without a title.  I''ll give you some credit because your focus is on the center of the flower which does stick to bees.  But without a title I would have seen it as just another flower shot. Technical:  It could use a little more focus.  The photo looks pretty blurry.  The crop is too tight, but if you were going to go that tight, you should have cut some of the greenery out of the bottom.  For an advanced editing challenge, I would have liked to have seen the colors boosted a little more as well.', '2006-12-23 00:21:13.000000', NULL, 1),
