(3146238, 439800, 68685, '<td valign="top">I should know what it is she''s eating, but my eyes are telling me it looks like something else.<br/> <br/>Gotta go get a bag now...</td>', 'I should know what it is she''s eating, but my eyes are telling me it looks like something else. Gotta go get a bag now...', '2006-12-24 12:53:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(3146240, 439005, 66384, '<td valign="top">I don''t know about bison tongues. Are they sticky. I''ll assume they are. I like the photo. Nice color on the bison. I''d like it better without the truck, which is distracting. The red pulls my eyes there, as though that is the focal point of the shot, but it is blurred, so it becomes annoying.</td>', 'I don''t know about bison tongues. Are they sticky. I''ll assume they are. I like the photo. Nice color on the bison. I''d like it better without the truck, which is distracting. The red pulls my eyes there, as though that is the focal point of the shot, but it is blurred, so it becomes annoying.', '2006-12-24 12:53:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(3146416, 439831, 67671, '<td valign="top">that looks realy sticky, good sharp picture, and well framed, topped with a lovely pair of feet. well done.</td>', 'that looks realy sticky, good sharp picture, and well framed, topped with a lovely pair of feet. well done.', '2006-12-24 15:59:03.000000', NULL, 1),
