(3146690, 439871, 60173, '<td valign="top">Were you scared of the sticky challenge? The whole point of the challenge was to make a mess! Ignore what you were told as a child.. schmear it around!</td>', 'Were you scared of the sticky challenge? The whole point of the challenge was to make a mess! Ignore what you were told as a child.. schmear it around!', '2006-12-24 20:46:22.000000', NULL, 1),
