(3148132, 439320, 55838, '<td valign="top">Mmmmmm...hairy lolipop!  Congratulation on top 20.  Love the christmas tree lights - great idea!  Excellent model.</td>', 'Mmmmmm...hairy lolipop!  Congratulation on top 20.  Love the christmas tree lights - great idea!  Excellent model.', '2006-12-25 15:00:13.000000', NULL, 0),
(3148142, 439255, 55838, '<td valign="top">Top 20 baby - woohoo!  Slightly less sexy than your WIND entry but hey, you can share your pops with me anytime....except the one on your neck...that''s just gross!  :)</td>', 'Top 20 baby - woohoo!  Slightly less sexy than your WIND entry but hey, you can share your pops with me anytime....except the one on your neck...that''s just gross!  :)', '2006-12-25 15:03:30.000000', NULL, 0),
