(3148181, 439831, 66384, '<td valign="top">I wondered how many people would to do this, and was surprised to see you were really the only one. I think you did it very well too. The framing is perfect, the foot position is very nice, and the gum -- well it couldn''t have been any better. I think you deserved a higher score, but congratulations on topping 6 anyway.</td>', 'I wondered how many people would to do this, and was surprised to see you were really the only one. I think you did it very well too. The framing is perfect, the foot position is very nice, and the gum -- well it couldn''t have been any better. I think you deserved a higher score, but congratulations on topping 6 anyway.', '2006-12-25 15:28:16.000000', NULL, 0),
(3148191, 439817, 67145, '<td valign="top">you''ve really done an excellent and imaginative design here ... how clever ... it has great composition, colours, and EVERYTHING!! ...<br/>and wot a great xmas present coming 5th ... well deserved ...</td>', 'you''ve really done an excellent and imaginative design here ... how clever ... it has great composition, colours, and EVERYTHING!! ...and wot a great xmas present coming 5th ... well deserved ...', '2006-12-25 15:36:05.000000', NULL, 0),
(3148201, 439867, 66384, '<td valign="top">Very nice clear, simple shot with good color and light. Interesting that the rose is already preparing for Spring.<br/> <br/>It should have scored higher, but what''s new there? Some people just don''t want to accept that there can be interpretations of the challenge that are different than theirs. (Hmmm... maybe that''s why there is so much fighting going on in the world today -- people just won''t allow alternative ideas.)</td>', 'Very nice clear, simple shot with good color and light. Interesting that the rose is already preparing for Spring. It should have scored higher, but what''s new there? Some people just don''t want to accept that there can be interpretations of the challenge that are different than theirs. (Hmmm... maybe that''s why there is so much fighting going on in the world today -- people just won''t allow alternative ideas.)', '2006-12-25 15:46:12.000000', NULL, 0),
(3148216, 439831, 64929, '<td valign="top">One of my favorites of the challenge....Congrats on the new PB!<br/>***Merry Christmas***</td>', 'One of my favorites of the challenge....Congrats on the new PB!***Merry Christmas***', '2006-12-25 15:55:30.000000', NULL, 0),
(3148220, 439769, 52549, '<td valign="top">Hi Gaby, Great shot, I''m so pleased for you that it did well. Congrats on top 20.</td>', 'Hi Gaby, Great shot, I''m so pleased for you that it did well. Congrats on top 20.', '2006-12-25 15:59:48.000000', NULL, 0),
(3148234, 439880, 66384, '<td valign="top">Not a bad score at all, and in the top 50%. Good showing for something you thought would really suck.<br/> <br/>The focus is tack sharp, so don''t try to get away with anything naughty -- we have your finger prints.<br/> <br/>Your background is nice and white, which is something I have yet to achieve. I think a colored background might add a bit more appeal. While the skin tone and honey color are excellent, the over-all effect is rather colorless. Or how about black and white with spot color for the honey? I don''t know, I''m just trying to think of some ideas of how to improve the appeal of an already good image.</td>', 'Not a bad score at all, and in the top 50%. Good showing for something you thought would really suck. The focus is tack sharp, so don''t try to get away with anything naughty -- we have your finger prints. Your background is nice and white, which is something I have yet to achieve. I think a colored background might add a bit more appeal. While the skin tone and honey color are excellent, the over-all effect is rather colorless. Or how about black and white with spot color for the honey? I don''t know, I''m just trying to think of some ideas of how to improve the appeal of an already good image.', '2006-12-25 16:14:34.000000', NULL, 0),
(3148240, 438329, 66384, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by oOWonderBreadOo:</b></div><hr/><i> .... maybe shooting lower to the ground </i></td></tr></table> <br/>Good suggestion. Thank you. I will have other opportunities to try that.</td>', 'Originally posted by oOWonderBreadOo: .... maybe shooting lower to the ground  Good suggestion. Thank you. I will have other opportunities to try that.', '2006-12-25 16:28:50.000000', NULL, 0),
(3148243, 439237, 8891, '<td valign="top">LOLOL!  Yep...After I saw your post-it wig with the great Cirque du Soleil theme I breathed a very heavy sigh of relief that mine did not work out...Yours is so well done!!!  My wig looked like a cross between a clown and British barrister/judge!  Oy! Lots of curls....oh well....the flowers are cute though. I may shoot and post them later!....Big huge wonderful congrats on your Ribbon, Aimee! Certainly deserving....great set up and shot!</td>', 'LOLOL!  Yep...After I saw your post-it wig with the great Cirque du Soleil theme I breathed a very heavy sigh of relief that mine did not work out...Yours is so well done!!!  My wig looked like a cross between a clown and British barrister/judge!  Oy! Lots of curls....oh well....the flowers are cute though. I may shoot and post them later!....Big huge wonderful congrats on your Ribbon, Aimee! Certainly deserving....great set up and shot!', '2006-12-25 16:31:14.000000', NULL, 0),
(3148252, 439489, 66384, '<td valign="top">I agree with the OOF comments. Also I would like to see how this would look if the crop wasn''t quite so narrow. The cup seems cut off. The golden color is very nice, and the light is good.</td>', 'I agree with the OOF comments. Also I would like to see how this would look if the crop wasn''t quite so narrow. The cup seems cut off. The golden color is very nice, and the light is good.', '2006-12-25 16:46:29.000000', NULL, 0),
(3148341, 439698, 57886, '<td valign="top">Your sons are so beautiful... nice picture Gunnar.. AND happy Christmas, Gleðileg jól :o)</td>', 'Your sons are so beautiful... nice picture Gunnar.. AND happy Christmas, Gleðileg jól :o)', '2006-12-25 18:13:05.000000', NULL, 0),
(3148372, 439853, 57886, '<td valign="top">Congrats on this great image. I really like the crop you did and the idea works so well for this challenge.</td>', 'Congrats on this great image. I really like the crop you did and the idea works so well for this challenge.', '2006-12-25 18:30:39.000000', NULL, 0),
(3148388, 439817, 60915, '<td valign="top">Way to go Shez, very nice top 5 finish, I think it was worth the mess, eh?<br/>Congratulations!<br/></td>', 'Way to go Shez, very nice top 5 finish, I think it was worth the mess, eh?Congratulations!', '2006-12-25 18:51:03.000000', NULL, 0);
