(3148999, 439237, 30982, '<td valign="top">AIMEE!!!  Way to go!  I know you think this is creepy but I think it''s more intriguing than creepy.  And a ribbon, no less!  Of course, we all know the most important thing is you beat what''s-his-name again.  Really do like this shot.</td>', 'AIMEE!!!  Way to go!  I know you think this is creepy but I think it''s more intriguing than creepy.  And a ribbon, no less!  Of course, we all know the most important thing is you beat what''s-his-name again.  Really do like this shot.', '2006-12-26 02:12:49.000000', NULL, 0),
(3149101, 438329, 52130, '<td valign="top">owchie-wa-wa I saw one of those in bermuda when I was 6. It was huge! You captured the color wonderfully. I can''t imagine one stuck to my leg...I''d be so scared I''d pass out. Aren''t they letal??</td>', 'owchie-wa-wa I saw one of those in bermuda when I was 6. It was huge! You captured the color wonderfully. I can''t imagine one stuck to my leg...I''d be so scared I''d pass out. Aren''t they letal??', '2006-12-26 04:24:54.000000', NULL, 0),
