(3149139, 439817, 30982, '<td valign="top">Awesome, Shez!!!  5th place!  Woo hoo!!!  Great picture, and I can just imagine how much fun it was to do - thanks for sharing that in the photographer''s comments.  Way to go!</td>', 'Awesome, Shez!!!  5th place!  Woo hoo!!!  Great picture, and I can just imagine how much fun it was to do - thanks for sharing that in the photographer''s comments.  Way to go!', '2006-12-26 05:13:41.000000', NULL, 0),
